## Overview: two SQLite databases

Bible Alarm uses **two separate SQLite databases**:

1) **Schedule DB** (user data)
   - filename: `bibleAlarm.db` (`AppConstants.Database.ScheduleDatabaseFileName`)
   - context: `src/Bible.Alarm.Shared/Database/ScheduleDbContext.cs`
   - shipped as an embedded resource for “fast clean install”

2) **Media index DB** (catalog)
   - filename: `mediaIndex.db` (`AppConstants.Database.MediaIndexDatabaseFileName`)
   - context: `src/Bible.Alarm.Shared/Database/MediaDbContext.cs`
   - shipped as `index.zip` embedded resource and extracted at runtime

Both DbContexts are registered in DI in:
- `src/Bible.Alarm/Common/Helpers/ServiceRegistrationHelper.cs`
  - `UseSqlite(..., b => b.MigrationsAssembly("Bible.Alarm.Shared"))`

